-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DCC model train captures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Captures of a ZIMO MX645 (40.22) decoder.


Logic analyzer setup
--------------------

The logic analyzer used was a Pico2 (samplerate 1MHz) with an OpenRemise sniffer board (https://github.com/OpenRemise/Sniffer).

  Probe       DCC
  ------------------
  D2
  D3
  D4          P track
  D5          N track
  D6          BIDI


Captures
--------

  Capture         Action
  ----------------------------
  verify_cv1_0.sr Verify CV1=0
  verify_cv1_1.sr Verify CV1=0
  write_cv1.sr    Write CV1=4